OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway to close for bridge
OL,4,Ademolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorway will close in both
OL,7,Fdirections this weekend so that old
OL,8,Fbridges can be demolished as part of a
OL,9,Fmajor junction upgrade.
OL,11,FThe M3 will shut between junctions 8
OL,12,Fand 9 near Winchester from 21:00 BST on
OL,13,FFriday until 06:00 GMT on Monday, with
OL,14,Fa second closure on the same times from
OL,15,F6 to 9 November.
OL,17,FNational Highways said the #290m
OL,18,Fproject to rebuild junction 9 had
OL,19,Freached its halfway point and was on
OL,20,Ftrack to finish in summer 2028.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
